# NOTE (verified 2026-09-03): the build context is the maestro-harness
# workspace root, not this package directory — Docker only auto-discovers a
# .dockerignore that sits at the context root, and this docker buildx (v0.37.0)
# has no --ignorefile/--ignore-file flag to point at a different one. This
# file therefore does not currently reduce what gets sent to the daemon; it's
# kept for documentation and for local `docker build` runs from inside this
# directory with `.` as context. Correctness is unaffected either way — every
# COPY in the Dockerfile whitelists an exact path, so nothing extra reaches
# the final image regardless of what's in the build context tar.
node_modules
.git
tests
*.md
deepseek-harness/node_modules
deepseek-harness/**/lib
deepseek-harness/**/node_modules
